{"file_name": "Untitled design (7).png", "id": "760533521614935", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001703_760533524948268_5929132528678025364_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RGJ4KGIM8YgQ7kNvwGXW4hp&_nc_oc=Adq2WGWwnQ0IM8CWBiHWhXzBB2py0CZQ8PGheqlGof-kONcFsrQ14Q_OCQ5qJu8g8kE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCIb61afLoXwBbtW-mFOJbhE5LneQ1jBk5pdLtLdh-vlw&oe=6A62238E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "THE RETRIEVAL (2).png", "id": "1059497764697325", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982500_1059497768030658_269254459267951193_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jxc1B7ordj8Q7kNvwEerJFh&_nc_oc=AdoMTYDQ7sJOmWwu33bnxTQywiFt0dhzbOWkC86TkEAEpLSehEFZawSPaBB_u30arHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCHPzpHV70aVuT451Ot8SBCKkCsnMWod5AplxkMdwA1jA&oe=6A620D13"}, "display_name": "The Retrieval", "keywords": [], "long_description": "THE spaceship Prometheus has re-emerged after being lost for over 200 years. It's not responding to our calls or emitting any signals. The mission is simple: dock in, try to make contact with the crew and if not possible, learn what happened and leave.\n\n\nThe Retrieval is a sci-fi horror puzzle taking place in the far future. Navigate your way through abandoned spaceship learning what happened to the crew.\n\n If you enjoy puzzles games and mind bending horror environments - this game is for you. And remember, the deep space can play tricks to the mind..\n\nWarning: this game contains sudden horrifying moments.\n\nThis game will receive regular updates.", "short_description": "THE spaceship Prometheus has re-emerged after being lost for over 200 years. It's not responding to our calls or emitting any signals. The mission is simple: dock in, try to make contact with the crew and if not possible, learn what happened and leave.\n\nThe Retrieval is a sci-fi horror puzzle taki